# Slay the Enemy Commander (Q608) for a level 75 Ketra ally of level 4 holding the level 4 alliance mark: Kadun Zu Ketra
# offers the quest and the player takes it. Mos' death gives the head (cond 2, the middle sound first), and Kadun trades it
# for the Totem of Wisdom and 10000 experience, ending the quest. Holding the totem he is no longer offered it. The head
# going to every ally of the killer's party is in varka_party_test.go. Expectations replay the reference trace of this
# scenario.
